WEBVTT

00:00:15.508 --> 00:00:16.509
-(GASPS)
-(ROARS)

00:00:16.843 --> 00:00:17.844
(SHRIEKS)

00:00:34.193 --> 00:00:35.820
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:00:36.279 --> 00:00:38.114
(DOUGAL CHITTERING)

00:00:44.787 --> 00:00:47.457
(WHISPERING) Demiguise are
fundamentally peaceful,

00:00:47.623 --> 00:00:50.293
but they can give a nasty nip if provoked.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.296
You two,

00:00:53.838 --> 00:00:55.006
head that way.

00:00:55.381 --> 00:00:57.717
And try very hard not to be predictable.

00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:02.221
(SCREECHING IN DISTANCE)

00:01:03.056 --> 00:01:05.308
TINA: Was that the Demiguise?
NEWT: No.

00:01:05.475 --> 00:01:08.061
But I think it might be the reason
that the Demiguise is here.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:15.735
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:23.409 --> 00:01:25.578
NEWT: Its sight operates on probability,

00:01:25.912 --> 00:01:28.873
so it can foresee
the most likely immediate future.

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:32.418
TINA: What's it doing?

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:35.296
NEWT: He's babysitting.

00:01:36.631 --> 00:01:38.174
What did you just say?

00:01:38.341 --> 00:01:39.425
NEWT: This is my fault.

00:01:41.511 --> 00:01:45.390
I thought I had them all
but, uh, I must have miscounted.

00:01:48.393 --> 00:01:49.394
(RUSTLING)

00:01:50.103 --> 00:01:51.437
It was babysitting that?

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.151
(OCCAMY TRILLS SOFTLY)

00:02:04.784 --> 00:02:07.328
Occamies are choranaptyxic.

00:02:08.454 --> 00:02:10.957
So they grow to fill available space.

00:02:15.628 --> 00:02:16.879
Mummy's here.

00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:20.383
(CLINKING)

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.551
-(GLASS SHATTERS)
-(SCREECHING)

00:02:22.301 --> 00:02:23.970
-(GROANS)
-(CHITTERS)

00:02:27.974 --> 00:02:29.976
-(CLINKING)
-(SCREECHING)

00:02:31.144 --> 00:02:32.145
-Whoa. Whoa!
-(GASPS)

00:02:33.271 --> 00:02:34.272
Whoa!

00:02:37.984 --> 00:02:40.486
-We need an insect!
-Huh?

00:02:40.778 --> 00:02:43.030
Any kind of insect and a teapot.

00:02:44.574 --> 00:02:46.033
-Find a teapot!
-(GASPS)

00:02:50.371 --> 00:02:52.331
Whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:03:04.844 --> 00:03:05.845
(GROANS)

00:03:07.472 --> 00:03:08.514
Oh! No!

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.683
I got it! I'll get it!

00:03:11.392 --> 00:03:12.393
(GRUNTING)

00:03:14.312 --> 00:03:15.313
Teapot!

00:03:17.273 --> 00:03:18.274
(GASPS)

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:31.204
Roach in teapot.

00:03:32.997 --> 00:03:33.998
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:37.210
(SHUSHING)

00:03:39.504 --> 00:03:40.505
(GRUNTS)

00:04:11.494 --> 00:04:12.495
(SCREECHING)

00:04:18.668 --> 00:04:19.669
(CLINKING)

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:25.591
(BOTH PANTING)

00:04:26.425 --> 00:04:27.718
Choranaptyxic.

00:04:29.262 --> 00:04:31.764
They also shrink
to fit the available space.

00:04:33.266 --> 00:04:34.767
(SCREECHING)

00:04:37.311 --> 00:04:38.604
Tell me the truth.

00:04:40.439 --> 00:04:42.483
Was that everything
that came out of the case?

00:04:43.276 --> 00:04:44.735
That's everything.

00:04:46.237 --> 00:04:47.613
And that's the truth.

00:04:49.991 --> 00:04:50.992
(SIGHS)

00:04:51.576 --> 00:04:52.785
NEWT: Here she comes.

00:04:53.911 --> 00:04:55.788
You happy to be home? Yeah.

00:04:55.955 --> 00:04:57.498
Bet you're exhausted, buddy. Come on.

00:04:57.665 --> 00:04:58.916
Just place him in the middle there.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.210
There you go. That's right.

00:05:02.044 --> 00:05:03.087
(OCCAMIES TRILLING)

00:05:11.554 --> 00:05:12.847
(LOWING)

00:05:19.729 --> 00:05:20.813
(LAUGHS)

00:05:23.816 --> 00:05:24.817
Ow.

00:05:25.318 --> 00:05:26.319
(SQUEAKING)

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.738
Right.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.781
I think we need to talk.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.663
I wouldn't have let him keep you, Pickett.

00:05:38.664 --> 00:05:40.249
Think I would rather chop off my hand
than get rid of you

00:05:40.416 --> 00:05:42.793
after everything that you've done for me.
Now, come on.

00:05:44.462 --> 00:05:47.048
Think we've talked about
the sulking before, haven't we?

00:05:48.132 --> 00:05:49.133
Pickett?

00:05:51.552 --> 00:05:52.803
Come on, give me a smile.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.722
-Pickett, give me a--
-(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:05:56.515 --> 00:05:57.683
All right.

00:05:58.267 --> 00:05:59.644
Now that is beneath you.

00:06:07.526 --> 00:06:08.694
Hey, Newt.

00:06:10.863 --> 00:06:12.198
Who is she?

00:06:13.032 --> 00:06:14.241
Oh, that's no one.

00:06:16.535 --> 00:06:18.037
Leta Lestrange.

00:06:19.664 --> 00:06:20.998
I've heard of that family.

00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:25.086
Aren't they kind of, you know...

00:06:25.461 --> 00:06:27.213
Please don't read my mind.

